  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"card\">\n  <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n    <input id=\"left\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. -12.5\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n    <select id=\"operation\">\n      <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n      <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (&minus;)</option>\n      <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (&times;)</option>\n      <option value=\"divide\">Divide (&divide;)</option>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n    <input id=\"right\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 7\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n  </div>\n  <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"result\">Result</label>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"left right operation\">0</output>\n  </div>\n</main>\n<script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1b1b2f;\n  --card: #26264a;\n  --accent: #ffcc00;\n  --text: #f4f4ff;\n  --muted: #9a9ac0;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(45deg, #22223c 25%, transparent 25%),\n    linear-gradient(-45deg, #22223c 25%, transparent 25%),\n    linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 75%, #22223c 75%),\n    linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 75%, #22223c 75%);\n  background-size: 24px 24px;\n  background-position: 0 0, 0 12px, 12px -12px, -12px 0;\n  font-family: \"Courier New\", ui-monospace, monospace;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  padding: 24px;\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #000;\n}\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n.field { margin-bottom: 16px; }\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\ninput, select, output {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--muted);\n  outline: none;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.35);\n}\noutput {\n  display: block;\n  min-height: 48px;\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--accent);\n  font-weight: bold;\n  overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n}\nbutton {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--bg);\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border: 3px solid #000;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #000;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #ffd633; }\nbutton:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--text); outline-offset: 3px; }\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 #000;\n}\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const left = document.getElementById('left');\nconst right = document.getElementById('right');\nconst operation = document.getElementById('operation');\nconst calculate = document.getElementById('calculate');\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction parseValue(input) {\n  const raw = input.value.trim();\n  if (raw === '') return null;\n  const num = Number(raw);\n  return Number.isFinite(num) ? num : null;\n}\n\nfunction compute() {\n  const a = parseValue(left);\n  const b = parseValue(right);\n  if (a === null || b === null) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  let value;\n  switch (operation.value) {\n    case 'add': value = a + b; break;\n    case 'subtract': value = a - b; break;\n    case 'multiply': value = a * b; break;\n    case 'divide':\n      if (b === 0) { result.textContent = 'Error'; return; }\n      value = a / b;\n      break;\n    default: result.textContent = 'Error'; return;\n  }\n  result.textContent = Number.isFinite(value) ? String(value) : 'Error';\n}\n\ncalculate.addEventListener('click', compute);\n[left, right, operation].forEach((el) => {\n  el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') { e.preventDefault(); compute(); }\n  });\n});\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Calculator\n\nA pixel-style two-number calculator built with plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript. Runs fully offline — no packages, storage or network requests.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in **Left number** and **Right number** (negatives allowed, e.g. `-12.5`).\n3. Pick an operation: Add, Subtract, Multiply or Divide.\n4. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter in any field).\n5. The **Result** area shows only the numeric result. Invalid input (empty, non-finite) or division by zero shows exactly `Error`.\n\nThe result starts at `0`.\n\n## Features\n\n- Four operations: add, subtract, multiply, divide\n- Negative and decimal inputs supported\n- Exact `Error` text for empty, non-finite or divide-by-zero cases\n- Keyboard accessible with associated labels and visible focus states\n- Pixel-art theme with a cohesive palette, responsive down to 360px\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and labeled controls\n- `style.css` — pixel theme and layout\n- `script.js` — validation and calculation logic\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
